# Urdu Male Voice — Piper TTS (medium)

Urdu text-to-speech voice for [Piper](https://github.com/OHF-Voice/piper1-gpl).

## Overview

- **Language:** Urdu (`ur_PK`)
- **Voice:** Male
- **Quality:** Medium
- **Phonemizer:** eSpeak (`ur`)
- **Sample rate:** 22050 Hz
- **Current version:** v2 (October 2026)

